NOTES:
Thank you for installing Tyk Stack Chart. Your release is named tyk.

NOTE:
Tyk Dashboard connects to Tyk Gateway at http://gateway-svc-tyk-tyk-gateway.tyk-boot.svc over port 8080 for key management functions.
    Please double check if Tyk Gateway runs on this address. If not, Tyk Gateway host and Tyk Gateway port can be overridden
        through .tyk-dashboard.dashboard.tykApiHost and .tyk-dashboard.dashboard.tykApiPort fields respectively in values.yaml.

To quickly test everything is ok, you can port-forward Tyk Gateway pod:
    kubectl port-forward --namespace tyk-boot service/gateway-svc-tyk-tyk-gateway 8080:8080
    curl localhost:8080/hello

=== Tyk Dashboard Login Details ===
    export TYK_DASHBOARD_ADMINEMAIL=default@example.com
    export TYK_DASHBOARD_ADMINPASSWORD=$(kubectl get secret --namespace tyk-boot tyk-dashboard-login-details -o jsonpath="{.data.adminUserPassword}" | base64 --decode)

